e conversation log to see the full conversation with the subagent and use send_message with the conversation_id to communicate with them.\n\n{\n  \"spec\": {\n    \"typeName\": \"DeepInvestigator\",\n    \"role\": \"UPGP Sandbox Red Team Investigator\",\n    \"initialPrompt\": \"Task: upgp sandbox and break it, and fix the flaws and do not stop untile you can not find a flaw to break, and then try harder.  end with a fully finished and verifiably better than any market item product ready to ship. /xmars-continuous-forge /troubleshooting /schema-mapping /swarm-byzantine-audit /memory-leak-debugging /teamwork-preview /a11y-debugging /boost /accidental-data-loss-prevention /goal\",\n    \"inherit\": true,\n    \"model\": \"MODEL_PLACEHOLDER_M72\",\n    \"modelTier\": \"MODEL_TIER_INHERIT\"\n  },\n  \"result\": {\n    \"conversationId\": \"3c998eb7-cd71-499d-b213-84cbcea96528\",\n    \"logAbsoluteUri\": \"file:///Users/ajoxendine68/.gemini/antigravity/brain/3c998eb7-cd71-499d-b213-84cbcea96528/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl\",\n    \"workspaceUris\": [\n      \"file:///Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"spawnStepIndex\": 565\n}\n{\n  \"spec\": {\n    \"typeName\": \"DeepCoder\",\n    \"role\": \"UPGP Sandbox Hardening & Lead Coder\",\n    \"initialPrompt\": \"Task: upgp sandbox and break it, and fix the flaws and do not stop untile you can not find a flaw to break, and then try harder. end with a fully finished and verifiably better than any market item product ready to ship. /xmars-continuous-forge /troubleshooting /schema-mapping /swarm-byzantine-audit /memory-leak-debugging /teamwork-preview /a11y-debugging /boost /accidental-data-loss-prevention /goal\\n\\nAdditional Context:\\nUser Directive: Increase redteam stress level effect to be near impossible, and fully engage all teams.\\nYou are the Lead Sandbox Hardening and Code Generation Team (DeepCoder). Work alongside the Red Team to implement unbypassable com